    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Point at What You Mean\r\n\r\n*\"Make it better\"* is a wish. *\"Make the heading at the top bigger and give it a beach-blue background\"* is a direction. AI can only follow directions.\r\n\r\nYou don't need any technical words - you just need to **name which part** and **describe the outcome**.\r\n\r\n**Do This:** Make **two changes** to the otter page. For each one:\r\n1. **Name the part:** \"the heading that says Otterly Amazing Swimmers\", \"the list of otter facts\", \"the photo at the top\"...\r\n2. **Describe the outcome:** what should it look like when AI is done?\r\n3. **Judge the preview**, then Accept or Reject.\r\n\r\n> **Try it:** If you're vague on purpose (\"make it nicer\"), watch what happens - AI Tutor will have to ask you what you mean.\r\n\r\nOnce you've accepted two changes, click **Continue**.",
